      "message": "This sets a global option for all LDAP connections, not just whatever this object is. Would it make more sense to set a global option outside of any particular object? I\u0027m worried that a connection might somehow get made before a BaseLdap is created and then wouldn\u0027t get the option, but then a BaseLdap gets created and now every connection created since then gets the option.\n\nI\u0027d be happier if this was either done:\na) on startup, e.g., in \u0027main()\u0027, so it\u0027s more obvious that all LDAP connections will get this option, or\nb) on each individual connection rather than globally.\n\nI slightly prefer the individual connection approach... seems more flexible.",
